    "title": "2 killed in vehicle crash in southwest Charlotte, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Chrisman ,\n5 hours ago CHARLOTTE, N.C. (WBTV) - Two people were killed and a third one was injured Wednesday evening after a vehicle crash in southwest Charlotte, according to police. Charlotte-Mecklenburg police said on Wednesday, May 13, around 6:45 p.m. two people were killed in a vehicle crash off Westinghouse Boulevard. The intersection of South Tryon Street and Westinghouse Blvd. were closed due to the crash. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
